      "type": "faq",
      "h2": "Frequently asked questions about Relvo's reporting.",
      "items": [
        {
          "q": "Which metrics are included?",
          "a": "MRR and ARR with their waterfall, recurring revenue versus usage by metric, invoicing, collections, accounts receivable, DSO, days to invoice and revenue recognition under IFRS 15."
        },
        {
          "q": "Where does the data come from?",
          "a": "The same system that calculates, invoices and collects. MRR and ARR come from active contracts; invoiced and collected amounts are recorded separately, with their respective dates."
        },
        {
          "q": "What are DSO and DTI?",
          "a": "DSO measures days to collect an invoice; DTI, days to issue it after the period ends. Together they show how quickly you turn work into cash."
        },
        {
          "q": "Does Relvo handle revenue recognition?",
          "a": "Yes, under IFRS 15."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can I see metrics by customer?",
          "a": "Yes. Every number can be broken down by customer, period or metric."
        }
